.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.smairt/
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/README.md

# This project is a committed reference demo, not a working researcher project. The rules above are
# right for a researcher -- data and logs are usually large, regenerable, or private -- but here the
# small cited fixtures and the run evidence are the point: without them a reader clones a demo that
# cannot run and cites logs that are absent. Re-included deliberately.
!data/**/*.csv
!results/logs/*.log
